| (Initial State)       |
+-----------+-----------+
            |
            v
+-----------------------+
| Node: classify_intent |
| (MOCK_LLM: Keyword    |
|  Heuristic)           |
+-----------+-----------+
            |
            v
+-----------------------+
|   Conditional Edge:   |
|     route_intent      |
|   (Based on Class.)   |
+-----------+-----------+
     /             \
    /               \
   v                 v
+-----------------+  +------------------+
| Node:           |  | Node:            |
| retrieve_and_answer |  | direct_answer    |
| (Policy Qs)     |  | (General Qs)     |
| (MOCK_LLM: Retr.-> |  | (MOCK_LLM: Static |
|  Templated Ans.)|  |  Response)       |
+---------^-------+  +--------^---------+
          |                  |
          |                  |
+---------+---------+  +-----+------------+
| ChromaDB Vectorstore|  | No Retrieval   |
| (Embeddings, Chunks)|  | or LLM Call    |
+---------------------+  | (Mock Mode)    |
                         +------------------+

Output from retrieve_and_answer or direct_answer -> Pydantic AnswerSchema (JSON)
```
